# Configuration Examples - Listing Home Assistant

## Installation

1. Copy the `custom_components/listing_homeassistant` folder to your Home Assistant `custom_components` folder
2. Restart Home Assistant
3. Go to Settings > Devices & Services > + Add Integration
4. Search for "Listing Home Assistant" and add it

