## Automation Examples

### Daily Auto-Export

```yaml
automation:
  - alias: "Daily Listing Export"
    trigger:
      - platform: time
        at: "00:00:00"
    action:
      - service: button.press
        target:
          entity_id: button.exporter_en_yaml
```

### Weekly Refresh

```yaml
automation:
  - alias: "Weekly Listing Refresh"
    trigger:
      - platform: time
        at: "00:00:00"
    condition:
      - condition: time
        weekday:
          - mon
    action:
      - service: button.press
        target:
          entity_id: button.actualiser_les_donnees
```

### Device Count Notification

```yaml
automation:
  - alias: "New Device Alert"
    trigger:
      - platform: state
        entity_id: sensor.listing_home_assistant_devices
    action:
      - service: notify.mobile_app
        data:
          title: "Device Count Changed"
          message: "Total devices: {{ states('sensor.listing_home_assistant_devices') }}"
```

### Automatic Interval Adjustment

```yaml
automation:
  - alias: "Night Mode - Slower Updates"
    trigger:
      - platform: time
        at: "22:00:00"
    action:
      - service: select.select_option
        target:
          entity_id: select.intervalle_de_mise_a_jour
        data:
          option: "Tous les jours"
          
  - alias: "Day Mode - Faster Updates"
    trigger:
      - platform: time
        at: "07:00:00"
    action:
      - service: select.select_option
        target:
          entity_id: select.intervalle_de_mise_a_jour
        data:
          option: "Toutes les heures"
```

## Template Examples

### Custom Sensors

```yaml
template:
  - sensor:
      - name: "Total Lights"
        state: >
          {{ state_attr('sensor.listing_home_assistant_entities', 'domain_counts').light | default(0) }}
        
      - name: "Active Automations"
        state: >
          {{ state_attr('sensor.listing_home_assistant_automations', 'automations') 
             | selectattr('state', 'equalto', 'on') | list | count }}
```

### Conditional Cards

